% ADJ52 case-21 program (this patient's observations + queries only; no rules).
% 52yo man, 3 years of recurrent, stereotyped spells: pounding heartbeat, profuse
% sweating, throbbing frontal headache, lightheadedness, a wave of nausea
% occasionally ending in vomiting, feeling suddenly drained and shaky. Spells come
% on shortly AFTER VOIDING (corroborated by patient + wife), building in the
% minutes after micturition then settling. Denies dysuria, hematuria, syncope,
% seizure, fever. Previously labeled panic/anxiety (started on an antidepressant),
% then a chronic-headache-plus-anxiety syndrome, with a note to rule out secondary
% causes. Broad labs unremarkable. Pelvic US: hypoechoic upper-anterior bladder-wall
% lesion, scant peripheral flow. CT urography: polypoid antero-superior/dome
% bladder mass, avid UNIFORM enhancement. Taken to OR for resection; shortly after
% induction BP climbed abruptly to 175/105 (controlled with IV nitrate); a firm
% nodular dome mass was found and a wedge (partial) cystectomy was carried out.

% --- the correlated catecholamine-surge paroxysm (one syndrome; mechanism fires once) ---
observe symptom(palpitations)
observe symptom(profuse_sweating)
observe symptom(throbbing_frontal_headache)
observe symptom(lightheadedness)
observe symptom(nausea)
observe symptom_occasional(vomiting)
observe symptom(drained_and_shaky)

% --- the two near-pathognomonic mechanical-release triggers ---
observe spell_trigger(post_voiding)
observe intraop_event(hypertensive_crisis_on_manipulation)

% --- spell tempo + imaging of the mass ---
observe spell_pattern(recurrent_stereotyped)
observe finding(polypoid_mass)
observe contrast_enhancement(avid_uniform)
observe mass_location(bladder_dome)
observe finding(scant_peripheral_blood_flow)

% --- pertinent negatives (argue against urothelial carcinoma) ---
observe denies(hematuria)

% --- the prior (mis)label ---
observe prior_diagnosis(presumed_panic_anxiety_disorder)

% NOT observed (open, decision-relevant): metanephrines(...) and histology(...)

% --- queries: each candidate diagnosis + the recommended next step ---
? diagnosis(bladder_paraganglioma)
? diagnosis(urothelial_carcinoma)
? diagnosis(panic_anxiety_disorder)
? diagnosis(benign_bladder_lesion)
? next_step(plasma_free_metanephrines_then_alpha_blockade)
